3.4 Replace Edge IDs with Indices
Join edges with the node index lookup table to replace from_id and to_id with their corresponding numeric indices.

mc3_edges_indexed &lt;- mc3_edges_cleaned %&gt;%
  left_join(node_index_lookup, by = c("from_id" = "id")) %&gt;%
  rename(from = .row_id) %&gt;%
  left_join(node_index_lookup, by = c("to_id" = "id")) %&gt;%
  rename(to = .row_id) %&gt;%
  select(from, to, is_inferred, type) %&gt;%
  filter(!is.na(from) & !is.na(to))


